  "summary": "This is a Phase 2, single center, proof of concept clinical trial in subjects with active IgG4-Related Disease (IgG4-RD). Approximately 10 subjects with active IgG4-RD will be enrolled into this study. Subjects will receive weekly subcutaneous doses of abatacept (125mg) for 24 doses (24 weeks).",
